{"role":"assistant","message":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Here is a concise report based on the repo under `/home/admin`.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Vue files (under `frontend/src`) — teacher + schedule / weekday\n\n**Primary enrollment / course-creation UI**\n\n| File | Role |\n|------|------|\n| `/home/admin/frontend/src/components/UniversalClassScheduler.vue` | Shared “統一排課” modal: **teacher** (`form.teacher_id` + `SearchableSelect`), **fixed weekdays** (`form.days_of_week` checkboxes), **per-day time slots** (`form.day_time_slots`: day, `start_time`, `duration_hours`, optional subject). Calendar builds `session_plan` and POSTs via `createUniversalClassSchedule` → **`POST /api/v1/class-sessions/batch`**. |\n| `/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/CourseManagement.vue` | Embeds `UniversalClassScheduler` for **「新增課程」** (`showBackfillModal`), passes `:teachers`, `:initial-teacher-id`, etc. Also has filters (`teacher_name`), edit flow with `teacher_id`, and legacy-style **補登** that can call `POST /api/v1/student-classes` (see backend note below). |\n| `/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/StudentsList.vue` | Same scheduler for **new course** when `showCourseModal && !editingCourseId` (`mode=\"create\"`), with `createUniversalClassSchedule` / duplicate intercept + `force: true`. |\n\n**Relevant sections (teacher + weekday / schedule)**\n\n- **UniversalClassScheduler** — teacher select and weekday / slot grid:\n\n```332:486:/home/admin/frontend/src/components/UniversalClassScheduler.vue\n              <div class=\"form-group\">\n                <label>老師 *</label>\n                <SearchableSelect\n                  v-model=\"form.teacher_id\"\n                  :options=\"teacherOptions\"\n                  placeholder=\"輸入老師姓名搜尋...\"\n                />\n              </div>\n// ...\n          <article class=\"scheduler-card\">\n            <h4>固定上課星期</h4>\n// ...\n            <div class=\"weekday-row\">\n              <label\n                v-for=\"day in weekdayOptions\"\n                :key=\"day.value\"\n                :class=\"['weekday-chip', { selected: form.days_of_week.includes(day.value) }]\"\n              >\n                <input v-model=\"form.days_of_week\" type=\"checkbox\" :value=\"day.value\" />\n                <span>{{ day.label }}</span>\n              </label>\n            </div>\n            <div v-if=\"selectedDays.length > 0\" class=\"weekday-slot-grid\">\n              <template v-for=\"day in selectedDays\" :key=\"`day-${day}`\">\n                <div\n                  v-for=\"(globalIdx, slotNum) in getSlotIndicesForDay(day)\"\n                  :key=\"`slot-${globalIdx}`\"\n                  class=\"weekday-slot-row per-day-row\"\n                >\n// ... subject select, start_time select, duration_hours ...\n```\n\n- **Payload** sent to the API (teacher + slots + `session_plan`):\n\n```1761:1798:/home/admin/frontend/src/components/UniversalClassScheduler.vue\n    const payload = {\n      branch_id: branchId,\n      student_id: Number(form.student_id),\n      teacher_id: Number(form.teacher_id),\n      subject: form.subject,\n      class_type: form.class_type,\n      confirmed_dates: [],\n      future_dates: [],\n      session_plan: sessionPlan,\n      days_of_week: [...(form.days_of_week || [])].map((d) => Number(d)).filter((d) => d >= 1 && d <= 7),\n      day_time_slots: normalizedDaySlots,\n      start_time: normalizedStartTime,\n      duration_minutes: durationMinutes,\n// ...\n      course_start_date: form.course_start_date || null,\n      mode: props.mode,\n    };\n```\n\n- **CourseManagement** — mounts the same component:\n\n```395:408:/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/CourseManagement.vue\n    <UniversalClassScheduler\n      v-if=\"showBackfillModal\"\n      title=\"新增課程（統一排課介面）\"\n      submit-label=\"建立課程\"\n      :branch-id=\"props.branchId\"\n      :students=\"schedulerStudents\"\n      :teachers=\"schedulerTeachers\"\n      :rooms=\"rooms\"\n      :initial-student-id=\"schedulerInitialStudentId\"\n      :initial-teacher-id=\"schedulerInitialTeacherId\"\n      mode=\"backfill\"\n      @cancel=\"showBackfillModal = false\"\n      @success=\"handleUniversalBackfillSuccess\"\n      @duplicate-course=\"handleSchedulerDuplicateCM\"\n    />\n```\n\n**Other `.vue` hits for `TeacherID` / `teacher_id` / `老師` (not the main enrollment form, but related)**\n\n- `/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/LearningRecordsPage.vue` — `form.TeacherID` for **評量** (director), filters `teacher_id`.\n- `/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/SmartCalendar.vue` — `modalForm.teacher_id`, `day_of_week`, `start_time` for calendar CRUD / 代課 (Supabase + API patterns).\n- `/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/TuitionCollectionPage.vue`, `ScheduleDiscrepancyPage.vue`, `ParentPortal.vue`, `App.vue`, `SubstituteTeacherPickerModal.vue` — display or teacher-adjacent flows.\n\n**API helper**\n\n- `/home/admin/frontend/src/lib/universalSchedulerApi.js` — `createUniversalClassSchedule` → `POST /api/v1/class-sessions/batch`.\n\n---\n\n## 2. `StudentClass` model (`/home/admin/backend/app/Models/StudentClass.php`)\n\n- **`$casts`:** none declared on this model.\n- **`$fillable` (full list):**  \n  `StudentID`, `GradeID`, `SubjectID`, **`TeacherID`**, `by1`, `Period`, `StartDate`, `EndDate`,  \n  **`week`, `time`**, **`week1`–`week6`, `time1`–`time6`**, **`duration1`–`duration6`**,  \n  `TotalHours`, `Memo`, `Charge`, `Pay`, `PayDate`, `Paid`, `Disconunt`, `Rate`, `LearnTimeID`, `RoomID`, `room_id`, `settlement_day`, `monthly_sessions`, `MDate`, `Stop`, `closed_reason`,  \n  **`ScheduleMode`, `SessionCount`, `RemainingSessions`**, `ClassType`, `UsedSessions`, **`SessionDuration`**, `rate_unit`, `PackageID`, `PackageTotalSessions`, `PackageName`.\n\n- **Teacher:** `belongsTo(User::class, 'TeacherID', 'id')` — **one teacher id per course row**.\n- **Schedule-ish helpers:** `resolveSessionDurationForWeekday(int $isoWeekday)` maps **`week1`/`duration1` … `week6`/`duration6`** (ISO weekday 1–7) with fallback to `SessionDuration`.\n\n---\n\n## 3. `StudentClassController::store` and how teacher / schedule / sessions work\n\n**Current behavior:** `store` **does not** run the old enrollment logic. It immediately returns **410** and tells clients to use batch class-sessions:\n\n```699:704:/home/admin/backend/app/Http/Controllers/StudentClassController.php\n    public function store(Request $request)\n    {\n        return response()->json([\n            'message' => 'Legacy scheduling endpoint retired. Use POST /api/v1/class-sessions/batch.',\n            'code' => 'legacy_schedule_endpoint_retired',\n        ], 410);\n```\n\n**Dead code after the `return` (for reference only)** still documents the **legacy** design:\n\n- Validate **`TeacherID`**, **`ScheduleSlots`** (`weekday` 0–6, `time` `H:i`), `ScheduleMode` (`date` / `count`), etc.\n- **`mapScheduleSlots`:** maps slots into **`week`/`week1`–`week6`** and **`time`/`time1`–`time6`** on the `StudentClass` row.\n- **`buildSessionsFromWeeklySchedule`:** for each calendar day between `StartDate` and `EndDate`, if **`$date->dayOfWeek` matches `slot['weekday']`**, append a **`ClassSession`** with `SessionDate`, `StartTime`, `EndTime` (duration from slot or `SessionDuration`).\n- **`buildSessionsForCount`:** count-based session generation from the same slot shape.\n- Teacher conflict checks via `detectTeacherConflicts` + `ScheduleGuardService`.\n\n**Active path today:** **`ClassSessionController::batchStore`** validates `teacher_id`, `days_of_week`, `day_time_slots`, `session_plan`, etc., and delegates to **`EnrollmentService::store`** (`/home/admin/backend/app/Services/EnrollmentService.php`).\n\nIn `EnrollmentService::store`, for each subject group it:\n\n1. Builds **`week1`–`week6`, `time1`–`time6`, `duration1`–`duration6`** from **`day_time_slots` / `days_of_week`** (weekdays **1–7 ISO**).\n2. Sets **`TeacherID`** from **`$data['teacher_id']`**.\n3. Sets **`week`** / **`time`** to a primary weekday and that group’s start time.\n4. Creates **`StudentClass`** via `createStudentClassResilient`.\n5. Creates **`ClassSession`** rows from **`session_plan`** / derived rows (`confirmed` vs `future`, times per row).\n6. Does **not** insert into the **`schedules`** Eloquent model in this service (no `Schedule::` usage there).\n\n---\n\n## 4. `schedules` table / `Schedule` model\n\n- **Model:** `/home/admin/backend/app/Models/Schedule.php` — table **`schedules`**.\n- **Fillable:** `student_id`, `teacher_id`, `subject`, `day_of_week`, `start_time`, `end_time`, `duration_hours`, `class_type`, `status`, `type`, `deduction`, `branch_id`, `schedule_date`, `student_course_id`, `original_schedule_id`.\n\n**Migration columns** (`/home/admin/backend/database/migrations/2026_03_13_000013_create_schedules_table.php`):  \n`id`, `student_id`, `teacher_id` (nullable), `subject`, `day_of_week`, `start_time`, `end_time`, `duration_hours`, `class_type`, `status` (default `scheduled`), `type` (default `normal`), `deduction`, `branch_id`, `schedule_date`, `student_course_id`, `original_schedule_id`, `timestamps`.  \nLater migrations add indexes / normalize `start_time` (`2026_04_21_*`).\n\n**Usage:** e.g. `ScheduleController` creates rows for director flows (leave, etc.); **`ClassSessionController`** joins **`schedules`** for **substitute** display (`original_schedule_id` / `student_course_id` ↔ `StudentClass.ID`).\n\n---\n\n## 5. `student_class_teachers` / multi-teacher table\n\n- **No** `student_class_teachers` (or similar) table or model appears in PHP/migrations searched.\n- **Multi-teacher** is modeled as **multiple `StudentClass` rows** (same student, same subject) with different **`TeacherID`**; `EnrollmentService` even emits a **`dual_teacher_warning`** when another active sibling course exists for the same subject.\n\n---\n\n## Summary: how teacher assignment and schedule slots work now\n\n| Layer | Mechanism |\n|--------|-----------|\n| **UI** | `UniversalClassScheduler` collects **`teacher_id`**, **`days_of_week`**, **`day_time_slots`** (per weekday: start time, duration, optional subject), and a **`session_plan`** of concrete dates/times; **`createUniversalClassSchedule`** → **`POST /api/v1/class-sessions/batch`**. |\n| **Course row** | One **`StudentClass`** per subject group with **`TeacherID`** = API `teacher_id`; recurring pattern stored in **`week`/`time`** plus **`week1`–`week6`**, **`time1`–`time6`**, **`duration1`–`duration6`**. |\n| **Occurrences** | **`ClassSession`** rows per **`session_plan`** entry (and related rules); not the `schedules` table inside `EnrollmentService`. |\n| **`schedules` table** | Separate recurring/operational records (e.g. leave, substitutes), linked with **`student_course_id`** to the course id, not the primary enrollment writer in `EnrollmentService`. |\n| **Legacy `StudentClassController::store`** | **Retired (410)**; any client still calling **`POST /api/v1/student-classes`** for create should migrate to **`class-sessions/batch`** (or handle 410). |\n\n[REDACTED]"}]}}